type: software
title: "Everything They Don't Tell You in the Claude Demo"
abstract: >-
  Talk slides and companion code demo for the TechTides 2026 talk on vibe coding and
  Claude Code. A one-time coupon redemption function is taken from spec to code
  to green tests to review, then shown failing under concurrent load (a
  check-then-act race condition), together with the fixed version.
